        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "left",
            "text": "Where the hell is the XPS-12 I swear it was there yesterday, or even this morning…",
            "audio": "s1r001.mp3"
        },
        "next": "line_1"
    },
    "line_1": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Fred",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": true
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "right",
            "text": "[i](I had just arrived back from my break.) *What a stressful day this was going to be!*[/i]",
            "audio": null
        },
        "next": "line_2"
    },
    "line_2": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Fred",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": true
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "right",
            "text": "[i](As always, Annabelle had already started driving everyone for the day, her voice resonating across the stage we were building.)[/i]",
            "audio": null
        },
        "next": "line_3"
    },
    "line_3": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Annabelle",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": true
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "left",
            "text": "Hophophop, this is the last day! I want everyone cool calm collected, ok? This is the last push.",
            "audio": "s1r004.mp3"
        },
        "next": "line_4"
    },
    "line_4": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Annabelle",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": true
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "left",
            "text": "Sarah, did you take care of the loose plank stage left?",
            "audio": "s1r005.mp3"
        },
        "next": "line_5"
    },
    "line_5": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Annabelle",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Sarah",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": true
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "right",
            "text": "Yes, Anna, all taken care of! Shouldn't be a problem.",
            "audio": "s1r006.mp3"
        },
        "next": "line_6"
    },
    "line_6": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Fred",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": true
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Sarah",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "left",
            "text": "Shouldn’t, or isn’t?",
            "audio": "s1r007.mp3"
        },
        "next": "line_7"
    },
    "line_7": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Fred",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Sarah",
            "mood": "irritated",
            "focus": true
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "right",
            "text": "[i](Sighs.)[/i] Isn’t, Fred. Isn’t.",
            "audio": "s1r008.mp3"
        },
        "next": "line_8"
    },
    "line_8": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Fred",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Sarah",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": true
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "right",
            "text": "Aren’t you busy looking for that C3PO anyways?",
            "audio": "s1r009.mp3"
        },
        "next": "line_9"
    },
    "line_9": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Fred",
            "mood": "annoyed",
            "focus": true
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Sarah",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "left",
            "text": "XPS-12! It’s called XPS-12. You should know that already. How the hell am I supposed to adapt to 110V when the commutator is tuned to 60Hz and the…",
            "audio": "s1r010.mp3"
        },
        "next": "line_10"
    },
    "line_10": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Fred",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Sarah",
            "mood": "irritated",
            "focus": true
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "right",
            "text": "Screw you! You know nobody but you gives a damn about that…",
            "audio": "s1r011.mp3"
        },
        "next": "line_11"
    },
    "line_11": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Annabelle",
            "mood": "concerned",
            "focus": true
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Sarah",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "left",
            "text": "Enough, the both of you! We don’t have time for this. Plus, you’re scaring the new kid!",
            "audio": "s1r012.mp3"
        },
        "next": "line_12"
    },
    "line_12": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Annabelle",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": true
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "right",
            "text": "I might be young, but i ain’t no kid! I know my stuff!",
            "audio": null
        },
        "next": "line_13"
    },
    "line_13": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Annabelle",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": true
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "left",
            "text": "I know, I know. You’re not a kid.",
            "audio": "s1r014.mp3"
        },
        "next": "line_14"
    },
    "line_14": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Fred",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": true
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "left",
            "text": "Have YOU seen it, by the way? I swear it was right there yesterday.",
            "audio": "s1r015.mp3"
        },
        "next": "line_15"
    },
    "line_15": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Fred",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": true
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "right",
            "text": "[i](He turns to you saying this.)[/i] Hum, no, I don’t think…",
            "audio": null
        },
        "next": "line_16"
    },
    "line_16": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Fred",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Sarah",
            "mood": "irritated",
            "focus": true
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "right",
            "text": "We don’t know where your stupid cable is, ok? Nobody touches lights except you. Go and find it yourself, mister expert!",
            "audio": "s1r017.mp3"
        },
        "next": "line_17"
    },
    "line_17": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Fred",
            "mood": "annoyed",
            "focus": true
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Sarah",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "left",
            "text": "[i](Under his breath.)[/i] Mister expert, mister expert. I’ll show you, mister…",
            "audio": "s1r018.mp3"
        },
        "next": "line_18"
    },
    "line_18": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Boss",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": true
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "left",
            "text": "[i](Grizzle noise.)[/i] Attention please! Everyone. Boss speaking.",
            "audio": "s1r019.mp3"
        },
        "next": "line_19"
    },
    "line_19": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Boss",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": true
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "left",
            "text": "Due to unforeseen and mysterious circumstances, that will not be elaborated on, the planning has been reshuffled.",
            "audio": "s1r020.mp3"
        },
        "next": "line_20"
    },
    "line_20": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Boss",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": true
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "left",
            "text": "You have to get all of the stage ready before 4 pm. It means you have 6 hours to do the job.",
            "audio": "s1r021.mp3"
        },
        "next": "line_21"
    },
    "line_21": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Boss",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": true
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "left",
            "text": "No overtime allowed.",
            "audio": "s1r022.mp3"
        },
        "next": "line_22"
    },
