        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Boss",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Sarah",
            "mood": "irritated",
            "focus": true
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "right",
            "text": "What the hell? We were supposed to have until 10 to finish!",
            "audio": "s1r023.mp3"
        },
        "next": "line_23"
    },
    "line_23": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": true
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Sarah",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": true
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "left",
            "text": "[i]*She tensed up saying this. She looked surprised, but quickly regained her composure listening to the rest of the message.*[/i]",
            "audio": null
        },
        "next": "line_24"
    },
    "line_24": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Boss",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": true
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "left",
            "text": "The success of the festival depends on this. Accordingly, if the stage isn’t ready in time, i’ll be docking your pays and looking for a more competent team for the rest of the season.",
            "audio": "s1r025.mp3"
        },
        "next": "line_25"
    },
    "line_25": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Boss",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": true
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "right",
            "text": "[i]*Damn! I’ll have to skip post-lunch nap…*[/i]",
            "audio": null
        },
        "next": "line_26"
    },
    "line_26": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Boss",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Annabelle",
            "mood": "concerned",
            "focus": true
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "right",
            "text": "Oh… [i](Softly, so as not to be heard.)[/i] God damnit. How are we going to make it in time? [i](Louder, to everyone.)[/i] OK les amis, now we really have to stick together! Serrer les coudes!",
            "audio": "s1r027.mp3"
        },
        "next": "line_27"
    },
